Body:
@vuthanhtrung2010 while I understand this should be built in functionality you could use in meantime some of the suggested plugins people made or write your own. Many of these plugins are just starhoarders that won't be maintained. I personally use for last 5-6months https://github.com/yuhp/opencode-models-discovery, very active development. 

AFAIR this is not only issue regarding auto-discovery there are at least 3 another open and people complain there too. I believe PRs are accepted when they have relatively lot of attention and we were not able to do this for 6 months. This issue has 200 people while PRs 10 reactions.
I would also want to hide 3rd party remote providers, that i'm certain I won't ever use or more preferably have local & remote only search switchable with arrows and settable in config which one should be prioritized.
